🇺🇸🇨🇳NEW VIDEO: Who and What is Behind the Nvidia Coup & the US-China AI Race

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/3qkF9pQ-_Ws?si=_Wwx1WbNd5A0qX93

▪️The "spy investigation" was clearly political circus meant to remove Jensen Huang who built Nvidia up from the beginning and specifically because he resisted tightening restrictions on China; 

▪️Nvidia will now be used as part of the wider "wonder weapon" push the US believes AI will enable, the US thinks will allow it to "beat" China and reassert global primacy; 

▪️Claims regarding an "Israeli takeover" are based on social media posts and a single out-of-context quote from Nvidia's CFO regarding "Israeli executives;" 

▪️In reality, Nvidia bought and now controls Israeli-based company Mellanox requiring the CFO to talk to its executives in Israel because of timezones, talks that involve the CFO directing Mellanox which works FOR Nvidia;
